1. SELECT field: portfolio_ref, option: "<portfolio_ref>"
2. SELECT field: as_of_date, option: "<as_of_date>"
3. NOTE Sarwa exposes no clean web export. Capture only the selected portfolio's positions, cash, activity, and summary from the authenticated dashboard.
4. NOTE Store only the approved portfolio label or last four digits. Values are USD. Include the selected as-of date and every omitted-history limitation.
5. ASSERT condition: "pagination_exhausted == true"
6. NOTE Page only the selected portfolio. Stop at 100 pages, or earlier when Next is disabled or a page adds no new stable instrument IDs; record pagination_exhausted.
7. ASSERT condition: "duplicate stable instrument IDs are rejected"
8. UPLOAD as: "sarwa_holdings_<portfolio_ref>_<as_of_date>.json"
